  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Ugh! They're still fighting back!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Skullshatterer!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "As long as we can push them back, victory will be ours!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Yes...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Right now... we have no choice but to fight.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "These guys... are pretty tough!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Gaah-! Damn, that shield of yours...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Sh-she's the one from the L.G.D...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "It's not too late to put down your weapons and surrender...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "Unless you want to die in vain right here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "You'd expect us to believe you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Liar! Ursus... they've said the same thing before. But they executed those Infected, one by one...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "I hid beneath the bodies of the slain, holding my breath, in order to survive.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "There are no depths to which your kind won't stoop... in order to exterminate us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Aren't you just trying to round us up so you can kill us faster?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Very well. You've made your choice then.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "You're not getting through to them, big fella. They won't listen to reason.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "They can't even distinguish between good and even, Lungmen and Ursus.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "In that place... No, in many places...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Only hatred exists between those who are infected and those who are not.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "It seems that because of that... all communication has broken down. Even though there's another path in front of our eyes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Another path?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "What... could we possibly do?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "And what could you accomplish?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Don't waste any more time listening to their lies! Skullshatterer, let's get rid of them together!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "Explosions?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "He's planning to surround us from multiple directions!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Our flank will collapse if we can't seize the initiative... Prepare to counterattack!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Skullshatterer! I'll cover you! Just kill them, and the battle will be over!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Skullshatterer...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "I have to go back... with all of you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "I have to...!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "----------",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "We don't have much time left!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Hoshiguma.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "I'm ready.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Act carefully. Don't show the enemy any signs of weakness.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "I won't give them an opening!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "Watch out, the enemy is charging forward!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Amiya! Stay away from the enemy...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Th-that's...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Doctor... Doctor, what should I do...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "You know what you have to do, Amiya.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "But I don't want to...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I'm sorry, Doctor... I...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
          "text": "...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
          "text": "A-...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
          "text": "Amiya...?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Why...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "You...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Why did you become like this...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
          "text": "Amiya... I guess this was our fate all along.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "Amiya! What are you doing? Hurry...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "Tsk...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Madam Ch'en? I...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "That's enough.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "It's time...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "...to put an end to this.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Madam Ch'en...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "There is one thing I must tell you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "From now on, you'd better treat all Infected the same way... ...as your enemies.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "Life is unfair.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "If you want to hate someone, then hate me.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "text": "L.G.D.! Attack!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
